# Quick Start Guide

## Build Your Presentation

Run this command to build your slides:

```bash
docker run --rm \
  -v $(pwd):/data \
  registry.gitlab.com/woofi4/public/pandoc-presentation-creator:IMAGE_TYPE_PLACEHOLDER-latest \
  --defaults /opt/pandoc/defaults/beamer.yaml \
  --metadata-file=/data/config/config.yaml \
  /data/slides/Example.md \
  -o /data/output/presentation.OUTPUT_EXT_PLACEHOLDER
```

## Output

Your presentation will be generated as: `output/presentation.OUTPUT_EXT_PLACEHOLDER`

## Editing

1. **Edit content**: Modify `slides/Example.md` with your content
2. **Change settings**: Update `config/config.yaml` (theme, metadata, etc.)
3. **Rebuild**: Run the docker command above

## Available Docker Images

- `pandoc-beamer:latest` - For PDF (Beamer) output
- `pandoc-revealjs:latest` - For HTML (Reveal.js) output

## Advanced Usage

### Custom Output Name
```bash
docker run --rm \
  -v $(pwd):/data \
  registry.gitlab.com/woofi4/public/pandoc-presentation-creator/pandoc-IMAGE_TYPE_PLACEHOLDER:latest \
  --defaults /opt/pandoc/defaults/beamer.yaml \
  --metadata-file=/data/config/config.yaml \
  /data/slides/Example.md \
  -o /data/output/my-presentation.OUTPUT_EXT_PLACEHOLDER
```

### Multiple Input Files
```bash
docker run --rm \
  -v $(pwd):/data \
  registry.gitlab.com/woofi4/public/pandoc-presentation-creator:IMAGE_TYPE_PLACEHOLDER-latest \
  --defaults /opt/pandoc/defaults/beamer.yaml \
  --metadata-file=/data/config/config.yaml \
  --metadata-file=/data/config/config_2.yaml \
  /data/slides/intro.md /data/slides/main.md /data/slides/conclusion.md \
  -o /data/output/full-presentation.OUTPUT_EXT_PLACEHOLDER
```

### Override Metadata
```bash
docker run --rm \
  -v $(pwd):/data \
  registry.gitlab.com/woofi4/public/pandoc-presentation-creator:IMAGE_TYPE_PLACEHOLDER-latest \
  --defaults /opt/pandoc/defaults/beamer.yaml \
  --metadata title="My Custom Title" \
  /data/slides/Example.md \
  -o /data/output/presentation.OUTPUT_EXT_PLACEHOLDER
```
